<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Biggest gains/falls for ASX 100 index in last week - Nov 11.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Biggest gains/falls for ASX 100 index in last week - Nov 11.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following is a list of the 10 largest gaining and falling stocks for Australian companies included in the Australian Stock Exchange's ASX 100 index for the week to November 8.</p>
<p>Top 10 largest gains in week</p>
<p>Rank Name				    Price     pct change</p>
<p>1   Cortecs International		4.62	 10.00</p>
<p>2   Leighton Holdings		    6.20	  7.83</p>
<p>3   Lihir Gold			     2.42	  7.56</p>
<p>4   Village Roadshow		     5.58	  6.29</p>
